sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client App
    participant CHR as consciousness-service<br/>:8096
    participant ST as sentence-transformers<br/>all-MiniLM-L6-v2
    participant CHIT as CHIT Module<br/>pmoves.chit
    participant NATS as NATS<br/>Geometry Bus
    participant HIRAG as Hi-RAG v2<br/>:8086
    participant HD as Hyperdimensions<br/>Three.js

    Client->>CHR: POST /chr/run<br/>units: TextUnit[]

    Note over CHR: Initialize K anchors<br/>K = min(5, len(units))

    CHR->>ST: Generate embeddings<br/>model: all-MiniLM-L6-v2
    ST-->>CHR: vector[384] per unit

    loop CHR Clustering Iterations
        Note over CHR: Assign points to nearest anchor<br/>softmax-based probability
        Note over CHR: Update anchor positions<br/>weighted mean of assigned points
    end

    CHR->>CHR: Calculate MHEP<br/>Mean Hyperbolic Energy Potential

    Note over CHIT: Construct CGP Packet<br/>spec: chit.cgp.v1.0
    CHIT->>CHIT: Add constellations[]<br/>with anchors, points, spectrum

    alt CHIT_PASSPHRASE set
        CHIT->>CHIT: Sign CGP packet<br/>HMAC-SHA256
    end

    CHR->>NATS: Publish geometry.cgp.v1<br/>{cgp_packet}
    CHR->>NATS: Publish tokenism.cgp.ready.v1<br/>{cgp_summary}

    par Concurrent Subscribers
        NATS->>HIRAG: Consume geometry.cgp.v1
        Note over HIRAG: Index for hybrid RAG<br/>Vector + Graph + Full-text
    and
        NATS->>HD: Consume via Portal
        Note over HD: Render 3D constellation<br/>Three.js WebGL
    end

    CHR-->>Client: CHRResult<br/>{cgp, mhep, constellations}

    Note over Client,HD: CGP available for<br/>visualization, indexing,<br/>and attribution tracking
